# Local QA artefacts. This is a backend repo — it has never tracked a single
# image — but ~55 screenshots, a screen recording and 285 Playwright output
# files piled up at the root during visual verification, plus a stray _site/
# that was an accidental 85-file snapshot of the repo itself. About 20 MB of
# nothing. Rooted patterns (/*.png, not *.png) so a real asset committed in a
# subdirectory would still be tracked.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp
/*.mp4
/.playwright-mcp/
/_site/
